sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PRED as PredictionService
    participant UQ as UQService
    participant EXP as ExplainabilityService
    participant CONS as Consensus
    participant PHYS as PhysicsValidationService
    participant DSS as DecisionSupportService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant UI as Dashboard

    Note over PRED: CME candidate v=2800 km/s, impact_prob=0.87

    PRED->>UQ: compute_intervals()
    PRED->>EXP: generate_explanations()
    UQ->>CONS: PI90, agreement=0.91
    EXP->>CONS: "High speed + wide halo"

    Note over CONS: RF · XGB · LSTM · Transformer agree<br/>Consensus: HIGH RISK

    CONS->>DB: INSERT predictions (is_consensus=true)
    CONS->>PHYS: validate(consensus)

    PHYS->>PHYS: PHY-10 speed → PASS
    PHYS->>PHYS: PHY-11 kinematic → PASS
    PHYS->>PHYS: PHY-03 dynamic pressure P_d=28 nPa >> 15 nPa
    Note over PHYS: HARD_FAIL

    PHYS->>DB: INSERT physics_validation_results<br/>(HARD_FAIL, automation_allowed=false)

    PHYS->>DSS: ValidationResult + confidence_multiplier=0.25
    Note over DSS: Mode = ADVISORY_ONLY<br/>Suppress automated safe-mode

    DSS->>DB: INSERT recommendations<br/>(scientist_review, manual_review_required, HIGH)
    DSS->>DB: INSERT audit_logs (physics_blocked)

    UI->>DB: GET event + physics status
    UI-->>UI: Warning banner: consensus high-risk<br/>but PHY-03 failed — manual review required
    UI-->>UI: Grey out automated ops actions
